    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4d8f39e6_22ed60a5",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/bluetooth/ModuleBluetooth.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 85,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-09T17:14:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my understanding, it will not. By \"static\" I did not mean \"hardcoded\". If we look at the config: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/services/audiopolicy/config/bluetooth_audio_policy_configuration_7_0.xml, profiles are specified either for device ports, or for mix ports. Thus, the BT configuration does not fall into the case of \"dynamic configuration both for mix ports and device ports.\" What I have referred to as \"static\" is the fact that the HAL does not have to populate profiles by querying the connected devices, like it\u0027s done for HDMI and USB.",
      "parentUuid": "e4c21d1b_504f07df",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 85,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 85,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "03ce968bf744b711f8121f1a346183b69bc10df6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2af07cbc_a7c99619",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/bluetooth/ModuleBluetooth.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 85,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-10T09:27:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "so populateConnectedDevicePort() is only called if the connected device port profile list is empty?",
      "parentUuid": "4d8f39e6_22ed60a5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 85,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 85,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "03ce968bf744b711f8121f1a346183b69bc10df6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "781c1557_6e4f98ee",
        "filename": "audio/aidl/default/bluetooth/ModuleBluetooth.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 2
